{"id":"f74af78814931ea0","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-restricted-foundation.md","title":"限制在给定类上的集合基础公理","display":"df-restricted-foundation — 限制在给定类上的集合基础公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-restricted-foundation","aliases":["18-df-restricted-foundation"],"display":"df-restricted-foundation — 限制在给定类上的集合基础公理","depends_on":["[[./18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]","[[18-df-substitution-formula]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"§11.6 formula (Found(X)) following Exercise 11.6.3","source_printed_pages":"263","source_pdf_pages":"272","source_correspondence":"explicit-local-expansion","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","source_proof_review":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited record; not a new source check","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-restricted-foundation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-restricted-foundation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-restricted-foundation — 限制在给定类上的集合基础公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.6 formula (Found(X)) following Exercise 11.6.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"263"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"272"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"定义的语法、类型及构造已核对；不据此宣称后续定理已证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> 和逻辑等号的一阶签名；公式、出现变量、新变量选择和捕获规避替换分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"./18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a>。本节点所有操作均在同一签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 上实例化。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 为指定的形式参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P)\\)</span> 是公式构造函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fnd}[P]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fnd}[P]\\)</span> 只在已固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的上下文中作别名。新变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,y,z\\rangle\">\\(\\langle u,y,z\\rangle\\)</span> 取下式指定的唯一值，不进行额外改名。公式的其余自由变量仍为自由参数；作为公理使用时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是当前语言的变量项或常元项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(a)\">\\(q(a)\\)</span> 为下式选择的变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Found}(a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Found}(a)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Found}_*\">\\(\\mathrm{Found}_*\\)</span> 均为单个公式，而非对全部公式取实例的模式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 是签名变量枚举的首项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec b_x(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{New}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathrm{Occ}_{\\mathcal L}(P)\\cup\\{x\\},3),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall u\\Bigl[\n(\\exists y\\,(y\\in u\\land P[y/x]))\\to\n\\exists y\\bigl(y\\in u\\land P[y/x]\\land\n\\forall z\\,(z\\in y\\to(P[z/x]\\to\\neg(z\\in u)))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\quad(\\langle u,y,z\\rangle=\\vec b_x(P)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fnd}[P]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P),\\\\\nq(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{New}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathrm{Occ}_{\\mathcal L}(a),1)_0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Found}(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_{q(a)}(q(a)\\in a),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Found}_*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_{v_0}(v_0\\doteq v_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec b_x(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{New}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathrm{Occ}_{\\mathcal L}(P)\\cup\\{x\\},3),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall u\\Bigl[\n(\\exists y\\,(y\\in u\\land P[y/x]))\\to\n\\exists y\\bigl(y\\in u\\land P[y/x]\\land\n\\forall z\\,(z\\in y\\to(P[z/x]\\to\\neg(z\\in u)))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\quad(\\langle u,y,z\\rangle=\\vec b_x(P)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fnd}[P]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_x(P),\\\\\nq(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{New}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathrm{Occ}_{\\mathcal L}(a),1)_0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Found}(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_{q(a)}(q(a)\\in a),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Found}_*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fnd}_{v_0}(v_0\\doteq v_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 (Found(X)) 的类参数在这里用明确的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(x,\\vec p)\">\\(P(x,\\vec p)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in a\">\\(x\\in a\\)</span>，断言每个与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 相交的集合都有一个相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> 极小元。它与原书大写 (FOUND) 的全公式基础模式须分开。这里仅定义该公理，不把它作为元理论已证明的命题，也不对任意真类偷偷加入类量词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名；公式、出现变量、新变量选择和捕获规避替换分别取 [[./18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]。本节点所有操作均在同一签名 $\\mathcal L$ 上实例化。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名；公式、出现变量、新变量选择和捕获规避替换分别取 [[./18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]。本节点所有操作均在同一签名 $\\mathcal L$ 上实例化。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名；公式、出现变量、新变量选择和捕获规避替换分别取 [[./18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]。本节点所有操作均在同一签名 $\\mathcal L$ 上实例化。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{Fm